title: Ski Jump
text: The BENDER is a mirror set at a slant. It turns a beam halfway round a corner: from straight to diagonal, or from diagonal to straight. Send the skier down the slope and off the jump.
trick: routing with benders, diagonal to straight and back
motif: ski jump
ink: 2.5
expect: shared>=2
